{"title": "Gemless Ring", "pageid": 14370, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Gemless_Ring", "categories": ["Bugs", "Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gemless_Ring_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Gemless_Ring_Faded.png/300px-Gemless_Ring_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/e/e4/Gemless_Ring_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Gemless Ring image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Gemless_Ring_Faded.png/300px-Gemless_Ring_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Gemless_Ring_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <b>Gemless Ring</b> is a common yet one-of-a-kind <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Item</a> that can be combined with the <a href=\"/wiki/Ringless_Gem\" title=\"Ringless Gem\">Ringless Gem</a>. Primarily of use for bartering or sale to <a href=\"/wiki/Traders\" title=\"Traders\">Traders</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A ring that looks to have been deprived of its gem.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-e23743156caf5bb4END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-34c5aa00f25ab06fEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">QUEST_WYR_GemlessRing</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:QUEST_WYR_GemlessRing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:QUEST_WYR_GemlessRing\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">90b745f4-5166-49a5-9225-1234dde533ae</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:90b745f4-5166-49a5-9225-1234dde533ae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:90b745f4-5166-49a5-9225-1234dde533ae\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Looted from the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Garrett\" title=\"Garrett\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Portrait_Garrett.png/25px-Portrait_Garrett.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Portrait_Garrett.png/38px-Portrait_Garrett.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Portrait_Garrett.png/50px-Portrait_Garrett.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Refugee Corpse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Portrait_Garrett.png/25px-Portrait_Garrett.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Portrait_Garrett.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Garrett\" title=\"Garrett\">Refugee Corpse</a> on the cliffs of northeastern <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;46&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;66</span></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This ring can be combined with the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ringless_Gem\" title=\"Ringless Gem\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/GEM_Peridot_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-GEM_Peridot_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/GEM_Peridot_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-GEM_Peridot_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/GEM_Peridot_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-GEM_Peridot_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/GEM_Peridot_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-GEM_Peridot_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/GEM_Peridot_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ringless_Gem\" title=\"Ringless Gem\">Ringless Gem</a> sold by (or pickpocketed from) <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ferg_Drogher\" title=\"Ferg Drogher\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png/25px-Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png/38px-Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png/50px-Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ferg Drogher\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png/25px-Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ferg_Drogher\" title=\"Ferg Drogher\">Ferg Drogher</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;45&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-98</span> in the Rivington refugee camp.</li>\n<li>Combining the Gemless Ring and the Ringless Gem creates a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tarnished_Ring\" title=\"Tarnished Ring\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Ring_A_Simple_Gold_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Ring_A_Simple_Gold_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Ring_A_Simple_Gold_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Ring_A_Simple_Gold_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Ring_A_Simple_Gold_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Ring_A_Simple_Gold_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Ring_A_Simple_Gold_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Ring_A_Simple_Gold_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cd/Ring_A_Simple_Gold_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tarnished_Ring\" title=\"Tarnished Ring\">Tarnished Ring</a>. This item seems to have no purpose other than to be sold to <a href=\"/wiki/Traders\" title=\"Traders\">Traders</a> for a bit of extra gold.</li>\n<li>Using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Speak with Dead\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/38px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/50px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with Dead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Speak with Dead\">Speak with Dead</a> on the corpse holding the ring and learning about the Gemless Ring allows the party to bypass the check to access <a href=\"/wiki/Ferg_Drogher\" title=\"Ferg Drogher\">Ferg Drogher</a>'s secret stock.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The game code shows that the crafted ring should be named \"Magic Ring\" with the description \"Considered sacred by some gnomes and halflings, the gem set in this ring sparkles brilliantly.\" due to its <code>Item Template</code>.  However, when the game spawns items created via <code>Item Combination</code> it ignores <code>Item Template</code> and instead defaults to <code>Parent Template</code>, which in this case is <code>LOOT_GEN_Ring_A_Simple_Gold</code> and thus why the crafted ring appears with the name and description that it has.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714223055\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.089 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.093 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2672/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34794/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10759/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.017/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1107194/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,templa